graph TD
    subgraph Clients [AI 코딩 클라이언트]
        Client[grok build / Claude Code / Cursor / Codex / Gemini CLI / ...]
    end

    subgraph Orchestrator [Orchestrator - 단일 Rust 바이너리]
        subgraph Components [진입점]
            MCP[fleet-mcp<br/>7 tools]
            API[fleet-api<br/>REST + auth /metrics]
            Dash[fleet-dash<br/>HTML + SSE]
            CLI[fleet-cli<br/>workers/tasks/...]
        end
        
        Scheduler[fleet-scheduler<br/>• WorkerSelector hint+labels<br/>• CircuitBreaker 3-state<br/>• Dispatcher event loop<br/>• HealthChecker]
        Store[fleet-store Store trait<br/>• PgStore<br/>• migrations sqlx<br/>• LISTEN/NOTIFY]
        
        Components --> Scheduler
        Scheduler --> Store
    end

    DB[(PostgreSQL<br/>fleet_dev DB)]
    
    Client -->|MCP JSON-RPC stdio 또는 HTTP| Components
    Store --> DB

    subgraph Workers [워커 노드]
        WorkerA[Worker A Linux<br/>grok serve + cloudflared]
        WorkerN[Worker N Linux<br/>grok serve + cloudflared]
    end

    WorkerA -->|HTTP heartbeat| API
    WorkerN -->|HTTP heartbeat| API
    DB -.->|heartbeat status sync| Workers
